.TH ROT22 6.SH NAMErot22 \- software rot, as a screen toy.SH SYNOPSIS\fBrot22\fR[file].SH DESCRIPTION\fBrot22\fRputs a file, or its standard input, on the screen, and then lets it rot:the letters come loose a few at a time and fall to the bottom of thescreen, piling up, until the text has drained away.  It draws throughTERMCAP..PPIt is not\fBrot\fR,\fRwhich turns a file on its side.